{"id": "code_s001", "suite": "code", "prompt": "编写 Python 函数 solve(nums, target)，在有序数组 nums 中找到 target 的下标，不存在返回 -1。要求 O(log n) 思路（二分查找）。", "entry": "solve", "tests": [{"input": {"nums": [1, 3, 5, 7, 9], "target": 5}, "expected": 2}, {"input": {"nums": [1, 3, 5, 7, 9], "target": 4}, "expected": -1}, {"input": {"nums": [2], "target": 2}, "expected": 0}]}
{"id": "code_s002", "suite": "code", "prompt": "编写 Python 函数 solve(s)，判断字符串 s 是否为回文（只考虑字母数字，忽略大小写）。", "entry": "solve", "tests": [{"input": {"s": "A man a plan a canal Panama"}, "expected": true}, {"input": {"s": "race a car"}, "expected": false}, {"input": {"s": ""}, "expected": true}]}
{"id": "code_s003", "suite": "code", "prompt": "编写 Python 函数 solve(nums)，返回数组中只出现一次的那个元素，其余每个元素均出现两次。", "entry": "solve", "tests": [{"input": {"nums": [2, 2, 1]}, "expected": 1}, {"input": {"nums": [4, 1, 2, 1, 2]}, "expected": 4}, {"input": {"nums": [1]}, "expected": 1}]}
{"id": "code_s004", "suite": "code", "prompt": "编写 Python 函数 solve(n)，返回斐波那契数列第 n 项（n 从 0 开始，F(0)=0, F(1)=1）。", "entry": "solve", "tests": [{"input": {"n": 0}, "expected": 0}, {"input": {"n": 1}, "expected": 1}, {"input": {"n": 10}, "expected": 55}]}
{"id": "code_s005", "suite": "code", "prompt": "编写 Python 函数 solve(nums, target)，在数组中找到两数之和等于 target 的两个下标（保证有唯一解），返回 [i, j] 且 i < j。", "entry": "solve", "tests": [{"input": {"nums": [2, 7, 11, 15], "target": 9}, "expected": [0, 1]}, {"input": {"nums": [3, 2, 4], "target": 6}, "expected": [1, 2]}]}
{"id": "code_s006", "suite": "code", "prompt": "编写 Python 函数 solve(s)，将罗马数字字符串转换为整数。支持 I,V,X,L,C,D,M。", "entry": "solve", "tests": [{"input": {"s": "III"}, "expected": 3}, {"input": {"s": "IV"}, "expected": 4}, {"input": {"s": "MCMXCIV"}, "expected": 1994}]}
{"id": "code_s007", "suite": "code", "prompt": "编写 Python 函数 solve(s)，判断括号字符串是否有效（每个左括号有正确匹配的右括号且嵌套合法）。", "entry": "solve", "tests": [{"input": {"s": "()"}, "expected": true}, {"input": {"s": "()[]{}"}, "expected": true}, {"input": {"s": "(]"}, "expected": false}, {"input": {"s": "([)]"}, "expected": false}]}
{"id": "code_s008", "suite": "code", "prompt": "编写 Python 函数 solve(matrix)，将 m×n 矩阵顺时针旋转 90 度（原地修改并返回 matrix）。", "entry": "solve", "tests": [{"input": {"matrix": [[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6], [7, 8, 9]]}, "expected": [[7, 4, 1], [8, 5, 2], [9, 6, 3]]}]}
